  title="Wire Mesh Shipping & Packaging: How It Arrives Undamaged"
  description="Wire mesh shipping and packaging guide: roll vs panel packing, VCI moisture protection, pallet norms, container loading patterns, and how to file damage claims."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <nav class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-theme-primary">Home</a>
